\author{H. Barros and Y. Chen}
\date{July 2026}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\input{sections/background}
\input{sections/stations}
\input{sections/findings}
\end{document}

\section{Stations}
Six loggers report depth every two minutes over the mobile network.
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{ll}
\toprule
Station & Peak depth (\si{\centi\meter}) \\
\midrule
Harbour Road & 18 \\
Depot Gate & 9 & 22 \\
Tram Loop & 31 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
Tram Loop floods deepest because it drains the uphill car park.

